{"t_ms": 2057765, "conversation_id": "conv_sentence_end_s2_009", "turn_id": 1, "actor": "system", "event_type": "retrieval_result", "payload": {"passages": ["Lost & Found Policy\n\nGrand Horizon Hotel & Suites\n\nItems found within the hotel premises are recorded and securely stored by the housekeeping department. Guests who believe they have misplaced personal belongings should contact the Front Desk with a detailed description of the item. Unclaimed items are generally retained for 90 days before being disposed of in accordance with hotel policy.", "Luggage Storage Service\n\nGrand Horizon Hotel & Suites\n\nGuests may store their luggage securely at the reception before check-in or after check-out at no additional cost on the same day. Long-term luggage storage may be available upon request and is subject to space availability. The hotel recommends that guests avoid storing valuable items such as cash, jewellery, passports, or electronic devices in stored luggage.", "In-room Safe Instructions\n\nGrand Horizon Hotel & Suites\n\nEvery room is equipped with an electronic safety locker for storing valuables such as passports, cash, jewelry, and electronic devices. Guests are advised to set a personal PIN while using the safe. The hotel is not responsible for valuables left unsecured outside the in-room safe. For additional assistance, guests may contact the Front Desk."], "scores": [0.5225458741188049, 0.7414373159408569, 0.7883507013320923], "timing_policy": "sentence_end", "timing_trigger": "sentence_end", "user_end_known_at_finish": true, "launch_offset_ms_vs_user_end": 1354, "overlap_with_speech_ms": 0, "forecast_invalidated": false}}
